function bookRoom(uint roomId, uint nights) external payable {
    require(!roomBusy[roomId], "Room already booked");
    require(msg.value == price * nights, "Wrong amount");
    bookings[++id] = Booking(msg.sender, roomId, msg.value);
    roomBusy[roomId] = true;
    emit RoomBooked(id, msg.sender, roomId, msg.value);
}


The code fragment demonstrates the booking validation process. The contract verifies room availability, 
confirms the payment amount and records booking details before storing funds within the escrow mechanism.Simplified
from HotelBooking.sol: checks the room is free and the payment is exact, then records the booking.
